  "description": "YITAMOTOR high-quality headlights will let all of the light through, allowing your headlights to work the way they were originally made to.\nFitment\n2006-2011 Honda Civic Sedan(4-door)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nCompatibility: The LED DRL headlights assembly is compatible with 2006 2007 2008 2009 2010 2011 Honda Civic Sedan 4-Door models; high beam bulb type:9005(HB3); low beam bulb type:9006(HB4); bulbs are not included\nEnhanced Nighttime Visibility & Safety: Our LED DRL headlights with parabolic reflectors increase brightness, distance, and width of the light. This enhances visibility for drivers and passengers in dark, stormy, rainy, and other challenging conditions\nQuick & Easy Installation: Plug-and-play operation with direct bolt-on fitment, making it a simple replacement for the stock headlight. No drilling or modifications required. Professional installation is recommended for optimal results\nWeatherproof & Durable Design: Our LED DRL headlight assembly is fully sealed with high-grade silicone and features one-way vents to prevent moisture buildup. This solid design protects against corrosion and water damage for lasting durability\nRugged Construction for Shock Resistance: Built with ultra-durable polycarbonate lenses and reinforced housing, designed to withstand road debris, trail branches, and off-road vibrations. Trust its reliable performance through every adventure",
